    "critical_findings": [
      "Custom version1 teaching format, not JSON Schema/ODCS. Fields flat scalar only when declared; allow_extra=true admits extra nested/array values without validation.",
      "Python exact int excludes bool and31.0; number accepts arbitrary int including10**400 and finite float; JS safe-integer lab differs.",
      "Optional means may be absent; explicit null fails every supported declared type. No implicit coerce/fill/delete.",
      "Uniqueness per-column not composite; all members quarantined, including first. Missing/wrongtype ignored by index, other row-rule failures still indexed. number1/1.0 collide.",
      "Row-count dataset rules use original batch length. Clean accepted rows still exported when dataset fails. Re-evaluated accepted partition is new dataset, not retroactive pass or automatic discard permission.",
      "CLI default exit0 can have passed=false; --check quality fail1; caught invalid input/I/O/type error2. Original stage4 tests use CLI subprocess but we did not execute.",
      "Four output files non-atomic; may leave partial or stale artifacts. No run manifest/hashes/input identity/contract digest/revision/signature or override flow.",
      "Quarantine preserves raw original records; no general redaction. Reports avoid duplicate values but still disclose field names and row positions.",
      "json.loads default permits duplicate member lastwins and NaN/Infinity. Declared finite type checks quarantine NaN, but quarantine serializer allow_nan=False then fails export; CLI returns2 after earlier files may exist.",
      "CLI reads and parses whole text before API100000-row cap. No input byte/line/depth/field/string streaming limits.",
      "Unknown data/time/leakage/semantic truth are unsupported checks, not PASS. No actual cross-table or entity/time training-split checks.",
      "Contract validates bounds individually but does not prove enum intersects bounds; contradictory enum/bounds can pass schema validation. Whitespace field names accepted.",
      "HTML escapes generated issue and duplicate JSON text, but renderer assumes generated count/row_number/passed types; arbitrary external reports not fully validated.",
      "accepted/quarantine records are object aliases, not frozen independent evidence snapshots; later caller mutations can alter in-memory report. JSON output is serialized snapshot only."
    ],
